('/en/escalas-de-enfermagem/seguranca-do-paciente/index.html', 'en', 'secao', 'Patient Safety Scales: Morse and Downton | Fall Risk', 'Complete guide to patient safety scales: Morse and Downton for fall risk, Braden for pressure injury, and Barthel for functionality. Interactive calculators.', 'Home
