('/en/escalas-de-enfermagem/urgencia-emergencia/index.html', 'en', 'secao', 'Emergency and Urgency Scales: FAST, Cincinnati, Glasgow, NIHSS', 'Complete guide to emergency and urgency scales: FAST, Cincinnati, Glasgow, NIHSS, CURB-65, and SOFA. Stroke screening, rapid neurological assessment, and interactive calculators.', 'Home
