('/en/gotejamento.html', 'en', 'secao', 'IV Drip Rate Calculator: Drops and Microdrops per Minute | Nursing', 'Educational calculator to support IV drip rate calculation. Calculate macrodrops and microdrops per minute, checking prescription, IV set, institutional protocol, and professional evaluation.', 'Home
