--
Calculation Details and Guidelines
References:
1. BRAZIL. Ministry of Health.
Obesity
. Virtual Health Library (BVS MS). Available at:
https://bvsms.saude.gov.br/bvs/dicas/215_obesidade.html
. Accessed on: July 2, 2026.
2. WORLD HEALTH ORGANIZATION (WHO).
Obesity and Overweight
. Fact Sheet. Geneva: WHO, 2024. Available at:
