HARBISON, J. et al. Diagnostic accuracy of stroke referrals from primary care, emergency room physicians, and ambulance staff using the Face Arm Speech Test. Stroke , v. 34, n. 1, p. 71-76, 2003. DOI: 10.1161/01.STR.0000044170.46643.5E
