BROTT, T. et al. Measurements of acute cerebral infarction: a clinical examination scale. Stroke , v. 20, n. 7, p. 864-870, 1989. DOI: 10.1161/01.STR.20.7.864
LIM, W. S. et al. Defining community acquired pneumonia severity on presentation to hospital: an international derivation and validation study. Thorax , v. 58, n. 5, p. 377-382, 2003. DOI: 10.1136/thorax.58.5.377
